Archally Narrative Schema Tools
===============================

The tools in this directory are not all under the same licence. The
repository-root LICENSE is the authoritative map.

Apache License, Version 2.0 (see ../LICENSE-APACHE)

  validator/         standalone conformance validator
  port/              release and integrity tools
  README.md          tool documentation
  LICENSE            this licence map

Functional Source License 1.1, Apache 2.0 future licence (see ../LICENSE-FSL)

  model-builder/     builds a model's graph from its YAML files
  next-id/           suggests the next free identifier in a model
  semantic-checker/  model-quality rules and the adapter that feeds them

